## Part X: Architecture Reference

### Layer Hierarchy

```
Layer 0 (TOKENS)    → Individual words        [atomic units]
Layer 1 (BIGRAMS)   → Word pairs              [local patterns]
Layer 2 (CONCEPTS)  → Semantic clusters       [abstract ideas]
Layer 3 (DOCUMENTS) → Full documents          [complete entities]
```

### Five-Layer Module Architecture

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ORCHESTRATION LAYER — processor/ package (public API)                 │
│  • CorticalTextProcessor (mixin composition)                           │
│  • Staleness tracking, coordinates all components                      │
└─────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                  │
┌─────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ALGORITHM LAYER — analysis/, semantics/, embeddings/                  │
│  • PageRank, TF-IDF, clustering, semantic relations                   │
└─────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                  │
┌─────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  QUERY LAYER — query/ package                                          │
│  • expansion, search, passages, ranking, intent                        │
└─────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                  │
┌─────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  PERSISTENCE LAYER — persistence.py, chunk_index.py                   │
│  • Save/load, git-friendly chunk storage                              │
└─────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                                  │
┌─────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  FOUNDATION LAYER — minicolumn.py, layers.py, config.py, tokenizer.py │
│  • Core data structures, no external dependencies                      │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Module Map

```
cortical/
├── processor/           # Main API - START HERE
│   ├── core.py          # Initialization, staleness tracking (~100 lines)
│   ├── documents.py     # Document processing (~450 lines)
│   ├── compute.py       # PageRank, TF-IDF, clustering (~750 lines)
│   ├── query_api.py     # Search, expansion, retrieval (~550 lines)
│   └── persistence_api.py  # Save/load (~200 lines)
│
├── query/               # Search and retrieval
│   ├── expansion.py     # Query expansion
│   ├── search.py        # Document search
│   ├── passages.py      # Passage retrieval
│   ├── ranking.py       # Multi-stage ranking
│   └── intent.py        # Intent-based queries
│
├── analysis/            # Graph algorithms
│   ├── pagerank.py      # PageRank importance
│   ├── tfidf.py         # TF-IDF/BM25 scoring
│   └── clustering.py    # Louvain community detection
│
├── reasoning/           # Cognitive architecture
│   ├── woven_mind.py    # Dual-process facade
│   ├── loom.py          # Mode switching (fast/slow)
│   └── thought_graph.py # Graph-based reasoning
│
├── got/                 # Task tracking
│   ├── api.py           # GoTManager CRUD
│   └── query_builder.py # Fluent Query API
│
└── utils/               # Shared utilities
    ├── id_generation.py # Canonical ID generation
    ├── checksums.py     # Unified checksum computation
    └── persistence.py   # Atomic save utilities
```

### Key Data Structures

| Structure | Location | Purpose |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| `Minicolumn` | `minicolumn.py` | Core node with connections |
| `Edge` | `minicolumn.py` | Typed weighted connection |
| `HierarchicalLayer` | `layers.py` | Container with O(1) ID lookups |
| `CorticalConfig` | `config.py` | Configuration with validation |

### Semantic Relations

Relations between terms have typed weights:

| Relation | Weight | Example |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `IsA` | 1.5 | "dog IsA animal" |
| `SimilarTo` | 1.4 | "dog SimilarTo cat" |
| `PartOf` | 1.3 | "wheel PartOf car" |
| `DerivedFrom` | 1.2 | "quickly DerivedFrom quick" |
| `HasProperty` | 1.2 | "dog HasProperty loyal" |
| `Causes` | 1.1 | "rain Causes floods" |
| `RelatedTo` | 1.0 | Default co-occurrence |
| `CoOccurs` | 0.8 | Statistical co-occurrence |
| `Antonym` | 0.3 | "big Antonym small" (penalized) |

