## Part XIII: Quick Reference

### Most-Used Commands

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Process document | `processor.process_document(id, text)` |
| Build network | `processor.compute_all()` |
| Search | `processor.find_documents_for_query(query)` |
| Graph-boosted search | `processor.graph_boosted_search(query)` |
| Save state | `processor.save("corpus_state")` |
| Load state | `CorticalTextProcessor.load("corpus_state")` |
| Run smoke tests | `python -m pytest tests/smoke/ -v` |
| Create task | `python scripts/got_utils.py task create "Title"` |

### Commit Conventions

| Type | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `feat` | New feature |
| `fix` | Bug fix |
| `docs` | Documentation |
| `refactor` | Code refactoring |
| `test` | Adding tests |
